                                "sense_id": "7544a00d-d166-3cea-bdbd-045aaf4533e0",
                                "text": "In public he put on a performance that was at once outraged and outrageous, but usually he did not carry grudges into his private life. Exuding the backslapping air of a socializer who loved to gamble and drink, he could not understand why people whose careers he had ruined and publicly ridiculed would be hostile to his friendly advances."
